          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo olaiguanani o Haman ilo sirua te nebo Esta enkitok o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong e are, ina kata eokito enaisho oo sabibu, neitoki olaiguanani ajoki Esta, “Kainyoo eomonunoto ino Esta? Eikinchori iyie. Ainyoo eyieunoto ino? Tenaa ninye kolpisiai le nkitoo ai, naa keitabari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Esta ajoki, “Tenaa kanoto omom, too nkonyek inono, olaiguanani, naa te neitiship olaiguanani, nchoo maaishori enkishui ai te yieunoto ai, o ltung'ana laainei te nkomono ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etimiraki iyiook, nanu o ltung'ana laainei, pee emuti iyiook neari matuata neimisieki iyiook. Tenaa naaji ketimiraki iyiook aaitaa irindiki, ilewa o nkituaak, anaata atigire, amu meitanyaanyukieki osina lang enkitarruorroto to laiguanani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani Serser Esta, “Kaing'ae ilo, naa kaji etii, ilo oitieu ataasa ena?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Esta, “Olaarani naa olmang'atinta ninye; ele arruoni Haman!” Neureishoyu Haman te dukuya olaiguanani o enkitok o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinyototo olaiguanani te ilo sirua te ngoro nelo enkurma e ina aji e nkitoo; neton Haman aomonu enkishui enye te Esta enkitok o laiguanani, amu etoduaa ajo eitobirita olaiguanani entorroni naarie ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neshukunye olaiguanani eing'uaa ina kurma e nkaji e nkitoo elotu ewueji duoo neokie enaisho oo sabibu, ore Haman ina kata ebatata aomonu olng'ur, nebatatakino ina rruat natii Esta; nejo olaiguanani, “Keyieu neikony enkitok o laiguanani te dukuya nanu ti atua enkaji ai, Ore pee epuku ilo rorei te nkutuk o laiguanani neimulumuli enkomom e Haman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Harbona obo loo sunaishi oogelema ooisiaai olaiguanani, Ore ninye ilo shata ogorishoreki ooitobiraka Haman Mordekai, laa ororei lenye oitajeuo olaiguanani, neitasheyieki te nkaji e Haman naa intemat onom enkadoro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo olaiguanani, “Entiik elilio ninye te ilo shata.” Neilili Haman te ilo shata ogorishoreki apa oitobiraka Mordekai neyagaa engoro o laiguanani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
